<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ First caucus to meet at 10.30 a.m. NZT.</title>
<headline>NZ First caucus to meet at 10.30 a.m. NZT.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand First caucus and executive council will meet on Tuesday at 10.30 a.m., the party said in a statement.</p>
<p>After the meeting, NZ First is widely expected to announce who it is prepared to form a coalition with after the October 12 general election.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
